# Witylogix Platform Code Ownership
#
# This file defines code ownership and required reviewers for different parts of the codebase.
# When a pull request modifies files in any of these paths, the corresponding team/person
# is automatically requested for review.
#
# Format: <path> <owner> [additional-owners]
#
# Owners can be:
#   - GitHub users: @username
#   - Teams: @org/team-name
#   - Email addresses: user@example.com

